  ok   matching pair is GREEN (exit 0)
  ok   matching pair under different install paths is GREEN (exit 0)
  ok   Rustty fails a test the oracle passes is RED (exit 1)
  ok   Rustty passes a test the oracle fails is RED (exit 1)
  ok   known-bug against pass is RED (exit 1)
  ok   same failure, different detail is RED (exit 1)
  ok   a test missing from the Rustty log is RED (exit 1)
  ok   a test missing from the oracle log is RED (exit 1)
  ok   a Rustty log without a tally is RED (exit 1)
  ok   an oracle log without a tally is BLOCKED (exit 3)
  ok   two empty logs are RED (no tests compared) (exit 1)
  ok   a difference with its ledger row is GREEN (exit 0)
  ok   a ledger row whose difference no longer occurs is RED (stale) (exit 1)
  ok   a ledger row with other outcomes does not accept the difference (exit 1)
  ok   a ledger row without a UD/N record id is RED (exit 1)
  ok   a detail difference with its ledger row is GREEN (exit 0)
  ok   an absent oracle is BLOCKED (exit 3)
  ok   an oracle without the pinned commit is BLOCKED (exit 3)
  ok   CARGO_TARGET_DIR: fetch, build and the run use it; the fresh runner runs (exit 3)
  ok   CARGO_TARGET_DIR: a build that leaves no runner is RED, the stale one never runs (exit 1)
G-ESCTEST-SELF GREEN: every comparison arm holds on fixture logs.
